<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-MUNICIPALITIES BORROW 208.2 MLN KROONS IN H1.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-MUNICIPALITIES BORROW 208.2 MLN KROONS IN H1.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Local municipalities had borrowed 208.2 million kroons by the end of June, the finance ministry said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The sum has decreased considerably compared to the previous year,&quot; Veiko Tammearu of the budget department at the ministry told Reuters.</p>
<p>The municipalities had borrowed 667.6 million kroons during the same period last year.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
